error[NK2108]: This `return` leaves `self` without `self.items`.
   --> tests/views_a_field_of_mut_self_given_to_a_keep_parameter_is_refused.nika:16:3
    |
 15 | 		let k = kept_field_keeper(self.items)
    |                             ---------- taken out of `self` here
 16 | 		return k.len()
    |   ^^^^^^ leaves the function with the part still out
    |
    = note: The method takes `mut self`, so `self` is the caller's and is whole whenever the caller can see it. `self.items` was passed to `kept_field_keeper`, which keeps it, and nothing has put it back.
    = help: Assign `self.items` before the method is left, or take `keep self` and hand the value back.

